# Java Rules (Spring Boot 3 + Hexagonal Architecture)

## 🏗️ Structure (Hexagonal)
- Domain: `services/{svc}/src/main/java/com/ioes/{svc}/domain/`
- Application: `services/{svc}/src/main/java/com/ioes/{svc}/application/`
- Infrastructure: `services/{svc}/src/main/java/com/ioes/{svc}/infrastructure/`
- Interfaces: `services/{svc}/src/main/java/com/ioes/{svc}/interfaces/`
- Config: `services/{svc}/src/main/java/com/ioes/{svc}/config/`

## 📐 Layer Rules (BẮT BUỘC)
- ✅ Domain: POJO thuần, KHÔNG có framework dependencies
- ✅ Application: depend on Domain + Port interfaces
- ✅ Infrastructure: implement Port interfaces
- ✅ Interfaces: REST controllers, event listeners
- ❌ Domain KHÔNG được import Spring/Hibernate/JPA
- ❌ Application KHÔNG gọi trực tiếp infrastructure (qua port)

## 📐 Naming
- Class: PascalCase
- Method/Variable: camelCase
- Constant: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE
- Package: `com.ioes.{service}.{layer}`
- DTO: PascalCase + DTO
- UseCase: PascalCase + UseCase
- Controller: PascalCase + Controller
- Repository interface: PascalCase + Repository

## ✅ MUST
- Constructor injection (NO field injection @Autowired)
- Use SLF4J logger (NO System.out.println)
- Use Optional<T> thay vì return null
- Use record cho DTOs (Java 17)
- Bean Validation cho input (@NotNull, @Email, @Size)
- Global exception handler (@RestControllerAdvice)
- Structured logging với MDC
- Constructor final fields
- JUnit 5 + Mockito cho test

## ❌ NEVER
- Field injection (`@Autowired` trên field)
- `System.out.println` / `printStackTrace`
- `Optional.get()` không check isPresent
- Magic numbers
- Hardcoded secrets, URLs
- Cyclomatic complexity > 10
- File > 500 dòng
- Comment lặp lại code

## 🧪 Test
- JUnit 5 + Mockito
- Testcontainers cho integration test
- @SpringBootTest cho controller
- @ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class) cho unit test
- Coverage ≥ 85% business logic, ≥ 95% critical

